From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenBook <noreply@anybook.invalid>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] OPENBOOK: computer control: create the accessibility proxy
 before initialize()

ComputerControlSession's constructor called IComputerControlSession
.initialize() and only then created mAccessibilityProxy. The server
answers initialize() with IComputerControlLifecycleCallback.onActive()
on a binder thread right away, and onActive() registers that proxy with
AccessibilityManager. It was still null:

  java.lang.NullPointerException: Attempt to read from field
  '...AccessibilityDisplayProxy.mServiceClient' on a null object reference
    at AccessibilityManager.registerDisplayProxy(AccessibilityManager.java:2259)
    at ComputerControlSession$CallbackProxy$1.registerDisplayProxy(...)

(caught by Binder, so the session went on), and getAccessibilityWindows()
returned no windows for the whole session: the agent could not read the
apps it was automating. Seen in Cuttlefish with OpenBook's assistant,
Quire (ANAL-216).

Create the proxy first. It needs only the display id and the handler.
---
 .../virtual/computercontrol/ComputerControlSession.java     | 6 ++++--
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/core/java/android/companion/virtual/computercontrol/ComputerControlSession.java b/core/java/android/companion/virtual/computercontrol/ComputerControlSession.java
index e1abf841b0b7..02c4743de902 100644
--- a/core/java/android/companion/virtual/computercontrol/ComputerControlSession.java
+++ b/core/java/android/companion/virtual/computercontrol/ComputerControlSession.java
@@ -355,13 +355,15 @@ public final class ComputerControlSession implements AutoCloseable {
                 displayInfo.logicalHeight,
                 PixelFormat.RGBA_8888, /* maxImages= */ 2);
         mImageReader.setOnImageAvailableListener(reader -> onImageAvailable(), mHandler);
+        // OPENBOOK: before initialize(), which makes the server call onActive() on a binder
+        // thread at once; onActive() registers this proxy, and found it still null.
+        mAccessibilityProxy = new ComputerControlAccessibilityProxy(displayId, mHandler);
+
         try {
             mSession.initialize(mRemoteLifecycleCallback, mImageReader.getSurface());
         } catch (RemoteException e) {
             e.rethrowFromSystemServer();
         }
-
-        mAccessibilityProxy = new ComputerControlAccessibilityProxy(displayId, mHandler);
     }
 
     /**
